">out </span><span begin="00:14.130" end="00:14.280">I </span><span begin="00:14.280" end="00:14.400">think </span><span begin="00:14.400" end="00:14.520">my </span><span begin="00:14.520" end="00:14.880">battery </span><span begin="00:14.880" end="00:15.060">must </span><span begin="00:15.060" end="00:15.210">be </span><span begin="00:15.210" end="00:15.600">low</span><span begin="00:15.600" end="00:16.080">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.080" end="00:19.530"><span begin="00:16.080" end="00:16.440">Listen </span><span begin="00:16.440" end="00:16.560">if </span><span begin="00:16.560" end="00:16.650">you </span><span begin="00:16.650" end="00:16.800">can </span><span begin="00:16.800" end="00:17.010">hear </span><span begin="00:17.010" end="00:17.160">me </span><span begin="00:17.160" end="00:17.250">we're </span><span begin="00:17.250" end="00:17.520">goin' </span><span begin="00:17.520" end="00:17.640">to </span><span begin="00:17.640" end="00:17.670">a </span><span begin="00:17.670" end="00:18.060">place </span><span begin="00:18.060" end="00:18.540">nearby</span><span begin="00:18.540" end="00:18.540">, </span><span begin="00:18.540" end="00:19.050">alright</span><span begin="00:19.050" end="00:19.530">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.530" end="00:22.650"><span begin="00:19.530" end="00:19.830">Gotta </span><span begin="00:19.830" end="00:22.620">go</span><span begin="00:22.620" end="00:22.650">"</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.650" end="00:27.000"><span begin="00:22.650" end="00:22.800">Let </span><span begin="00:22.800" end="00:22.890">me </span><span begin="00:22.890" end="00:23.100">tell </span><span begin="00:23.100" end="00:23.250">you </span><span begin="00:23.250" end="00:23.340">the </span><span begin="00:23.340" end="00:23.850">story </span><span begin="00:23.850" end="00:24.240">about </span><span begin="00:24.240" end="00:24.450">the </span><span begin="00:24.450" end="00:24.840">call </span><span begin="00:24.840" end=