.040">tell </span><span begin="00:53.040" end="00:53.190">you </span><span begin="00:53.190" end="00:53.490">don't </span><span begin="00:53.490" end="00:54.630">worry</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.870" end="00:59.880"><span begin="00:54.870" end="00:55.200">I </span><span begin="00:55.200" end="00:55.470">will </span><span begin="00:55.470" end="00:55.680">be </span><span begin="00:55.680" end="00:56.220">late </span><span begin="00:56.220" end="00:56.520">don't </span><span begin="00:56.520" end="00:57.000">stay </span><span begin="00:57.000" end="00:57.510">up </span><span begin="00:57.510" end="00:58.020">and </span><span begin="00:58.020" end="00:58.530">wait </span><span begin="00:58.530" end="00:59.130">for </span><span begin="00:59.130" end="00:59.880">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.940" end="01:02.400"><span begin="00:59.940" end="01:00.060">I'll </span><span begin="01:00.060" end="01:00.300">say </span><span begin="01:00.300" end="01:00.750">again </span><span begin="01:00.750" end="01:01.410">you're </span><span begin="01:01.410" end="01:02.160">dropping </span><span begin="01:02.160" end="01:02.400">out</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.400" end="01:04.470"><span begin="01:02.400" end="01:02.670">My </span><span begin="01:02.670" end="01:03.570">battery </span><span begin="01:03.570" end="01:03.780">is </span><span begin="01:03.780" end="01:04.470">low</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.500" end="01:07.950"><span begin="01:04.500" end="01:04.740">Just </span><span begin="01:04.740" end="01:04.860">so </span><span begin="01:04.860" end="01:04.980">you </span><span begin="01:04.980" end="01:05.910">know</span><span begin="01:05.910" end="01:05.940">, </span><span begin="01:05.940" end="01:06.150">we're </span><span begin="01:06.150" end="01:06.450">goin' </span><span begin="01:06.450" end="01:06.630">to </span><span begin="01:06.630" end="01:06.720">a </span><span begin="01:06.720" end="01:07.050">place </span><span beg